Averon{"id":97,"date":"2023-01-18T17:10:27","date_gmt":"2023-01-18T17:10:42","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/personal-banking\/banking\/"},"modified":"2023-03-27T16:27:33","modified_gmt":"2023-03-27T16:27:33","slug":"personal-banking","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/","title":{"rendered":"Banking"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h1>We take your banking personally<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p>When anyone comes to Nebula Trust, we assume they have goals in mind. They might include anything from home ownership and financing an education to keeping on budget, building savings, and more. In every case, we\u2019re here to listen to your individual needs and offer solutions to help you reach your objectives.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-constrained wp-block-group is-style-open-account\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-4 wp-block-columns\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column\">\n<h2>Open an Account<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Whether in-person or online, a Nebula Trust team member can help customize your banking experience to your needs and guide you through account-opening.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\">\n<div class=\"is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-2 wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-btn-light\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/open-an-account\/\">OPEN AN ACCOUNT<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-constrained wp-block-group is-style-testimonial\">\n<p><strong>Nebula Trust is very helpful and their door is always open. It doesn\u2019t matter the branch, everyone is wonderful. I wouldn\u2019t want to go anywhere else!<\/strong><br>&#8211; <em>Deborah<\/em><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-10 wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-top is-style-info-block\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"255\" height=\"236\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/PB_Checking_01.png\" alt=\"A man looks at his online banking from his phone\" class=\"wp-image-1949\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-style-center-vertical\" style=\"padding-top:3rem;padding-right:3rem;padding-bottom:3rem;padding-left:3rem;flex-basis:75%\">\n<h2>Checking<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Looking for a checking account with a wide range of benefits? Nebula Trust has you covered.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/checking\/\">EXPLORE CHECKING<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-14 wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-top is-style-info-block\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-style-center-vertical\" style=\"padding-top:3rem;padding-right:3rem;padding-bottom:3rem;padding-left:3rem;flex-basis:75%\">\n<h2>Savings<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Tell us about your goals and we\u2019ll give you a savings plan to reach them.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/saving\/\">EXPLORE SAVINGS<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"255\" height=\"236\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/PB_Savings_01.png\" alt=\"A woman smiles while putting change in a piggy bank\" class=\"wp-image-1956\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-18 wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-top is-style-info-block\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"255\" height=\"236\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/PB_Lending_01-1.png\" alt=\"Three people look at paper work around a kitchen island\" class=\"wp-image-1957\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-style-center-vertical\" style=\"padding-top:3rem;padding-right:3rem;padding-bottom:3rem;padding-left:3rem;flex-basis:75%\">\n<h2>Lending<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>From mortgages and lines of credit to funds for unexpected expenses, we have a loan and support that will meet your needs.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/lending\/\">EXPLORE LENDING<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-22 wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-top is-style-info-block\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-style-center-vertical\" style=\"padding-top:3rem;padding-right:3rem;padding-bottom:3rem;padding-left:3rem;flex-basis:75%\">\n<h2>Digital Banking<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Online and mobile services allow you to access and manage your accounts anywhere you are.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/digital-banking\/\">EXPLORE DIGITAL BANKING<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"255\" height=\"236\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Smart_Card_PhoneApp_SQ.png\" alt=\"A hand holding a phone up with mobile banking services open\" class=\"wp-image-1955\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We take your banking personally When anyone comes to Nebula Trust, we assume they have goals in mind. They might include anything from home ownership and financing an education to keeping on budget, building savings, and more. In every case, we\u2019re here to listen to your individual needs and offer solutions to help you reach&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":43,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"service-page.blade.php","meta":[],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v20.1 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Personal Checking and Savings Accounts | Nebula Trust Bank<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"We offer checking, savings, CDs and money market accounts, consumer loans and mortgages, and convenience services, such as free online banking\/bill pay.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Personal Checking and Savings Accounts | Nebula Trust Bank\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"We offer checking, savings, CDs and money market accounts, consumer loans and mortgages